Subject: Add synchronized withdrawal of caller-owned display audio codec storage

Drain all table accesses through the existing publication mutex.
Prepare ready notifications under lock, then invoke their independent
callback snapshot. Permit identity-checked self-withdrawal from
synchronous extcon notifications without recursively acquiring the
mutex. Preserve existing exported APIs.

